n.21{ font-family:'等线 Light'; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; color:rgb(47,84,150); font-size:16.0000pt;} span.22{ font-family:等线; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; color:rgb(47,84,150); font-size:12.0000pt;} span.23{ font-family:等线; color:rgb(47,84,150); font-style:italic;} span.24{ font-family:等线; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; color:rgb(89,89,89); font-weight:bold;} span.25{ font-family:等线; mso-fareast-font-family:'等线 Light'; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; color:rgb(89,89,89);} span.26{ font-family:'等线 Light'; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing:-0.5000pt; font-size:28.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:14.0000pt;} span.27{ font-family:'等线 Light'; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; color:rgb(89,89,89); letter-spacing:0.7500pt; font-size:14.0000pt;} span.28{ font-family:等线; color:rgb(47,84,150); font-style:italic;} span.29{ font-family:等线; color:rgb(47,84,150); letter-spacing:0.2500pt; font-weight:bold;} p.MsoTitle{ mso-style-name:标题; margin-bottom:4.0000pt; mso-add-space:auto; mso-pagination:none; text-align:center; font-family:'等线 Light'; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing:-0.5000pt; font-size:28.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:14.0000pt;} p.31{ mso-style-name:Quote; margin-top:8.0000pt; margin-bottom:8.0000pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-family:等线; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; color:rgb(63,63,63); font-style:italic; font-size:11.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} p.MsoSubtitle{ mso-style-name:副标题; margin-bottom:8.0000pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-family:'等线 Light'; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; color:rgb(89,89,89); letter-spacing:0.7500pt; font-size:14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} p.33{ mso-style-name:\"List Paragraph\"; margin-bottom:8.0000pt; margin-left:36.0000pt; mso-add-space:auto; mso-pagination:none; line-height:115%; font-family:等线; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:11.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} p.34{ mso-style-name:\"Intense Quote\"; margin-top:18.0000pt; margin-right:43.2000pt; margin-bottom:18.0000pt; margin-left:43.2000pt; border-top:1.0000pt solid rgb(47,84,150); mso-border-top-alt:1px solid rgb(47,84,150); border-bottom:1.0000pt solid rgb(47,84,150); mso-border-bottom-alt:1px solid rgb(47,84,150); padding:10pt 0pt 10pt 0pt ; mso-pagination:none; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-family:等线; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; color:rgb(47,84,150); font-style:italic; font-size:11.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.3000pt 841.9000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:42.5500pt; mso-footer-margin:49.6000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p>这个夏天，运城姑娘赵子莹循着“返家乡”的号召，回到七彩盐湖畔，以青年志愿者的身份扎根家乡文旅一线。用真诚服务温暖八方来客，用踏实行动诠释青春担当，这段“盐韵青春・文旅共筑”的志愿故事，成为她夏日里最深刻的成长印记！让我们一同走进她的实践历程，感受这份扎根故土的温暖与力量。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MR-K4MRCiLzfknORrRo7-anlV7nRVxVUNnVMm67LlWfUlU0gihFp2hmCIa0USy4n1yDMSyDM7MfU4nkM7-PMzQkoRv8LRnRLRWkLmrfL8WFMm9ZUmrkMzQFMRLZUzvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A3F6564CAC4B4B156B87404C02B25A3B/688B5B56/438A7\" vheight=\"370\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MR-K4MRCiLzfknORrRo7-anlV7nRVxVUNnVMm67LlWfUlU0gihFp2hmCIa0USy4n1yDMSyDM7MfU4nkM7-PMzQkoRv8LRnRLRWkLmrfL8WFMm9ZUmrkMzQFMRLZUzvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>实践现场：以志愿之力，暖盐湖之约</strong></p><p>从贴心服务游客到统筹协调团队，她的每一份付出都闪耀着责任与担当。</p><p><strong>助力外地游客</strong>：遇到不会使用抖音购票的北京游客，她主动上前耐心引导，一步步协助完成操作，还细心告知入园路线和景区亮点，用真诚的笑容和周到的服务，让外地朋友真切感受到运城“宾至如归”的好客温度，收获了游客连连称赞。</p><p><strong>迎接领导视察：</strong>当副市长视察时，她提前梳理工作流程、规范服务话术，以精神饱满、从容大方的状态展现青年志愿者的良好风貌，用实际行动传递出当代青年对家乡文旅发展的热忱与担当，得到了领导的肯定与鼓励。<strong></strong></p><p><strong>履职组长职责：</strong>作为志愿小组组长，她全程统筹协调——每日提前到岗组织签到、根据游客流量灵活分配岗位、细心盘点分发物资、反复确认组员与游客的安全情况，在繁琐且细致的幕后工作中，锤炼了出色的组织协调能力，更让责任心在实践中愈发坚定。<strong></strong></p><p><strong>搭建国际桥梁：</strong>遇到前来游玩的俄罗斯友人，语言不通成为最大障碍，她急中生智用简单英语搭配手势比划，耐心沟通入园流程、解答疑问，全程面带微笑提供引导，成功帮助国际游客顺利入园，让志愿服务的温暖跨越语言国界，成为盐湖畔一道跨国界的暖心风景。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LzQKRMlUZMRA7nOmrkMlMkLR78Mm7xDU8lbU8WRLN-aMNU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh7MSysMSyPMz9bn7VRLR74L87Po7lYU8-Ynz7Po7nVUmQFozfVMRA7U8QFMRGaUzLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0D5751589DAC0133A18E2CB2E118DEB6/90E48DCF/400A3\" vheight=\"332\" vwidth=\"546\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LzQKRMlUZMRA7nOmrkMlMkLR78Mm7xDU8lbU8WRLN-aMNU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh7MSysMSyPMz9bn7VRLR74L87Po7lYU8-Ynz7Po7nVUmQFozfVMRA7U8QFMRGaUzLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/n7LKYUmrVM77ZLO4G8MzGsLN7bUl7xsoRL4nzWVoln2ozl0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyDMkhkn1yDL8VVM8U8nzvYnlWkUz98L4GPL7rRoRW2ozMFMNl4UzV2M4QFLmNsnmNJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E64BF63AE7D4E72EBBA843010EC82F93/6E3A1F76/297F9\" vheight=\"339\" vwidth=\"552\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/n7LKYUmrVM77ZLO4G8MzGsLN7bUl7xsoRL4nzWVoln2ozl0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyDMkhkn1yDL8VVM8U8nzvYnlWkUz98L4GPL7rRoRW2ozMFMNl4UzV2M4QFLmNsnmNJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>实践收获：在奉献中成长，在行动中收获</strong></p><p>这段志愿经历，让成长看得见、荣誉记心间。以实际行动为家乡文旅代言，深化了对家乡文化的认同与归属感，自豪感油然而生；累计收获百余小时志愿时长，成为参与家乡建设的珍贵见证；在团队协作与幕后统筹中，更深刻理解责任的意义，综合能力得到全方位提升。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LRNKPU4NPU8VRUOzlPUlQ2LRrknz6xRnzliUmLYUzvinzv0gihFp2hmCIa0M1y4oSysnkh7M7-Po7WfMRCYU47bo7LPLNlsLllaUzN8LRnFLmG8L8CaMlQFMRvboz7Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6397DD4B18BA462C198C12E71E0A9404/2043F05F/47991\" vheight=\"319\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LRNKPU4NPU8VRUOzlPUlQ2LRrknz6xRnzliUmLYUzvinzv0gihFp2hmCIa0M1y4oSysnkh7M7-Po7WfMRCYU47bo7LPLNlsLllaUzN8LRnFLmG8L8CaMlQFMRvboz7Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>志愿感悟：以青春之名，赴家乡之约</strong></p><p>“爱家乡”从来不是一句口号，而是落实在行动中的担当。赵子莹在实践中深刻意识到，青年既是家乡文化的传承者，更是家乡建设的参与者。志愿服务虽有辛劳，但游客的笑容、真诚的感谢，都成为支撑她前行的动力，让她真切体会到奉献的快乐与成长的价值。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/Lz-KbL7UiUmM7UOllDUN-YnRvbUlCxaolVfLz7PMNMknRl0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyZoSh2LSy8oRrfLm9bLRM2nllsnlQkL4MVL7C4LzA2UmWFnlLiM4v4MR6FL8U4UzlJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/589F1485A28903FEE7EFB33E0F318FB2/EC577347/3D3A5\" vheight=\"370\" vwidth=\"515\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MN7K8L8MfLzv4nOmv4LmUsMmW2Mm9xaLm9DLNWkozUYLzG0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysMkyDUSy4UlQfLzUiM7-4MzlZMNCiLl-PUN74MzGiMm6FnzrknznVMNVFoRCaLlUJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>这段充满温度的志愿记忆，不是终点，而是新的起点。青春的汗水浇灌故乡热土，每一次真诚付出都在为家乡绘就更明亮的底色。赵子莹将带着这份收获与感动继续前行，以实际行动续写“盐韵青春・文旅共筑”的精彩篇章，也期待更多青年扎根故土、奉献家乡，让青春在服务家乡的征程中绽放绚丽光彩！</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MR-K4MRCiLzfknORrRo7-anlV7nRVxVUNnVMm67LlWfUlU0gihFp2hmCIa0USy4n1yDMSyDM7MfU4nkM7-PMzQkoRv8LRnRLRWkLmrfL8WFMm9ZUmrkMzQFMRLZUzvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYL49JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17238&e=.png"}